    "An MCP server runs programs on this machine with Lumi's permissions — equivalent to executing arbitrary local commands. Only add servers you trust. Unknown tools default to high risk and require approval." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "An MCP server runs programs on this machine with Lumi's permissions — equivalent to executing arbitrary local commands. Only add servers you trust. Unknown tools default to high risk and require approval."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MCP 服务器会以 Lumi 的权限在本机运行程序——等同于执行任意本地命令。只添加你信任的服务器。未知工具默认为高风险并需要授权。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MCP 伺服器會以 Lumi 的權限在本機執行程式——等同於執行任意本機命令。只新增你信任的伺服器。未知工具預設為高風險並需要授權。"
          }
        },
        "zh-HK" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MCP 伺服器會以 Lumi 的權限在本機執行程式——等同於執行任意本機命令。只新增你信任的伺服器。未知工具預設為高風險並需要授權。"
          }
        },
        "zh-TW" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MCP 伺服器會以 Lumi 的權限在本機執行程式——等同於執行任意本機命令。只新增你信任的伺服器。未知工具預設為高風險並需要授權。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
